  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICRC operations by the Syrian Arab Republic Delegation(2026 Unaudited)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We are distributing food and other essentials to the people in Syria who are facing extremely difficult conditions because of the conflict and crisisSyria crisis: The ICRC is helping both people inside Syria, who are facing extremely difficult conditions because of the conflict, and the hundreds of thousands of Syrian refugees in Jordan, Lebanon, and Iraq.In cooperation with the Syrian Arab Red Crescent, we are distributing food and other essentials, restoring water supplies, and supporting medical services.</narrative>
  </description>
